<td sourcefile="Solutions/parcels-setup.md" sourcestartlinenumber="400">Recipient details for customs clearance purposes – contains <code sourcefile="Solutions/parcels-setup.md" sourcestartlinenumber="400">tin_number</code> and <code sourcefile="Solutions/parcels-setup.md" sourcestartlinenumber="400">tin_type</code>.</td>
<td sourcefile="Solutions/parcels-setup.md" sourcestartlinenumber="400">fedex</td>
</tr>
<tr sourcefile="Solutions/parcels-setup.md" sourcestartlinenumber="401">
<td sourcefile="Solutions/parcels-setup.md" sourcestartlinenumber="401"><code sourcefile="Solutions/parcels-setup.md" sourcestartlinenumber="401">rec_tin.tin_number</code></td>
<td sourcefile="Solutions/parcels-setup.md" sourcestartlinenumber="401">string</td>
<td sourcefile="Solutions/parcels-setup.md" sourcestartlinenumber="401">Tax identification number.</td>
<td sourcefile="Solutions/parcels-setup.md" sourcestartlinenumber="401">fedex</td>
</tr>
<tr sourcefile="Solutions/parcels-setup.md" sourcestartlinenumber="402">
<td sourcefile="Solutions/parcels-setup.md" sourcestartlinenumber="402"><code sourcefile="Solutions/parcels-setup.md" sourcestartlinenumber="402">rec_tin.tin_type</code></td>
<td sourcefile="Solutions/parcels-setup.md" sourcestartlinenumber="402">string</td>
<td sourcefile="Solutions/parcels-setup.md" sourcestartlinenumber="402">Type of tax ID (e.g. BUSINESS_UNION).</td>
<td sourcefile="Solutions/parcels-setup.md" sourcestartlinenumber="402">fedex</td>
</tr>
<tr sourcefile="Solutions/parcels-setup.md" sourcestartlinenumber="403">
<td sourcefile="Solutions/parcels-setup.md" sourcestartlinenumber="403"><code sourcefile="Solutions/parcels-setup.md" sourcestartlinenumber="403">return_barcode</code></td>
<td sourcefile="Solutions/parcels-setup.md" sourcestartlinenumber="403">bool</td>
<td sourcefile="Solutions/parcels-setup.md" sourcestartlinenumber="403">If used, returns the carrier's barcode information in the ADD response.</td>
<td sourcefile="Solutions/parcels-setup.md" sourcestartlinenumber="403">dpd; gls; ppl</td>
</tr>
<tr sourcefile="Solutions/parcels-setup.md" sourcestartlinenumber="404">
<td sourcefile="Solutions/parcels-setup.md" sourcestartlinenumber="404"><code sourcefile="Solutions/parcels-setup.md" sourcestartlinenumber="404">return_final_carrier_id</code></td>
<td sourcefile="Solutions/parcels-setup.md" sourcestartlinenumber="404">bool</td>
<td sourcefile="Solutions/parcels-setup.md" sourcestartlinenumber="404">To return the shipment ID within the final carrier (<code sourcefile="Solutions/parcels-setup.md" sourcestartlinenumber="404">carrier_id_final</code>, and for Zásilkovna also <code sourcefile="Solutions/parcels-setup.md" sourcestartlinenumber="404">track_url_final</code>) in the ADD response, send <code sourcefile="Solutions/parcels-setup.md" sourcestartlinenumber="404">TRUE</code>/<code sourcefile="Solutions/parcels-setup.md" sourcestartlinenumber="404">&quot;1&quot;</code>.</td>
<td sourcefile="Solutions/parcels-setup.md" sourcestartlinenumber="404">ppl; spring; zasilkovna</td>
</tr>
<tr sourcefile="Solutions/parcels-setup.md" sourcestartlinenumber="405">
