<td sourcefile="Solutions/parcels-setup.md" sourcestartlinenumber="405">string</td>
<td sourcefile="Solutions/parcels-setup.md" sourcestartlinenumber="405">The RMA_ASSOCIATION value will be printed on the label as a barcode for the return shipment (max 20 characters).</td>
<td sourcefile="Solutions/parcels-setup.md" sourcestartlinenumber="405">fedex</td>
</tr>
