<td sourcefile="Solutions/parcels-setup.md" sourcestartlinenumber="406">string</td>
<td sourcefile="Solutions/parcels-setup.md" sourcestartlinenumber="406">Numeric subtype/variant of the service type (not described in detail in the specification).</td>
<td sourcefile="Solutions/parcels-setup.md" sourcestartlinenumber="406">geis; ppl</td>
</tr>
<tr sourcefile="Solutions/parcels-setup.md" sourcestartlinenumber="407">
