<td sourcefile="Solutions/parcels-setup.md" sourcestartlinenumber="408">string</td>
<td sourcefile="Solutions/parcels-setup.md" sourcestartlinenumber="408">Required parameter for delivery to a parcel terminal/locker.</td>
<td sourcefile="Solutions/parcels-setup.md" sourcestartlinenumber="408">magyarposta; messenger</td>
</tr>
<tr sourcefile="Solutions/parcels-setup.md" sourcestartlinenumber="409">
