<td sourcefile="Solutions/parcels-setup.md" sourcestartlinenumber="409">bool</td>
<td sourcefile="Solutions/parcels-setup.md" sourcestartlinenumber="409">SMS service (SM1) – notification with the option to send custom text (<code sourcefile="Solutions/parcels-setup.md" sourcestartlinenumber="409">sm1_text</code>).</td>
<td sourcefile="Solutions/parcels-setup.md" sourcestartlinenumber="409">gls</td>
</tr>
