<td sourcefile="Solutions/parcels-setup.md" sourcestartlinenumber="410"><code sourcefile="Solutions/parcels-setup.md" sourcestartlinenumber="410">sm1_text</code></td>
<td sourcefile="Solutions/parcels-setup.md" sourcestartlinenumber="410">string</td>
<td sourcefile="Solutions/parcels-setup.md" sourcestartlinenumber="410">SMS text for the notification via <code sourcefile="Solutions/parcels-setup.md" sourcestartlinenumber="410">sm1_service</code> (max 160 characters, the variable <code sourcefile="Solutions/parcels-setup.md" sourcestartlinenumber="410">#ParcelNr#</code> can be used). If not sent, the text from the client zone is used.</td>
<td sourcefile="Solutions/parcels-setup.md" sourcestartlinenumber="410">gls</td>
</tr>
