<td sourcefile="Solutions/parcels-setup.md" sourcestartlinenumber="412">string</td>
<td sourcefile="Solutions/parcels-setup.md" sourcestartlinenumber="412">Country of origin of the goods; required for the Romanian logistics tax if <code sourcefile="Solutions/parcels-setup.md" sourcestartlinenumber="412">tax_subject = true</code>.</td>
